==Description==
The '''Curse Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 11 of the premium [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|310 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|52}} ({{Robux|39}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|1,740 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|562}} ({{Robux|429}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

The '''Curse Nametag''' has purple and dark purple gradient text and a black outline. It also emits a black and red fog behind itself, with multiple stars forming in it.

